# Extra apps installed system-wide (RPMs) in both images.
# One package per line. Searched in Fedora, Terra, Fedora Multimedia
# (negativo17, full codecs).
# Add a line, open a pull request, and every install gets it on the next
# update. Packages that can't be found fail the build, so typos are caught.
#
# Heavy, occasional tools are not listed here; they install on demand with
# ujust (see system_files/usr/share/ublue-os/just/horizon.just).

# Files (the file manager, Strata, comes from install-strata.sh)
gedit
# File dialogs for Event Horizon's settings (wallpaper "Open Picker...")
zenity

# Web
firefox
# Wi-Fi picker in a terminal (nmtui); the settings app's Scan button opens it
NetworkManager-tui

# Create
obs-studio

# Gaming (Steam itself already comes from Terra in Bazzite)
protonplus
heroic-games-launcher
# Bazzite removes GameMode; Horizon brings it back with its own config
# (see system_files/usr/share/bazzite-horizon/gamemode.ini).
gamemode
